Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Milestone 3: server, employees, onboarding by shop type,
 category-first UI

- Supabase Cloud: owner sign-in, create_store, background publishing
  (whitelisted fields only, published_at = sent updated_at)
- Invites by code, team list with revoke
- Employee mode: anonymous join, offline FTS5 search, cursor sync, revoke wipes data
- First launch: create shop / restore / join; router keeps employees out of owner screens
- Onboarding by shop type with starter categories and emoji; picker with shop
  sets and owner-added emoji; schema v6 (categories.emoji)
- New look: category cards home, phone bottom bar, tablet sidebar
- Recommended price confirmation is a popup
